        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1956_7273.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unsre fründt: Nachparlich und guetwillige dienst
<lb n="2"/>zůuor, Fürsichtig, Ersam, weijse, besondre
<lb n="3"/>Liebe fründ und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachparn</unclear>,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wasmaßen</unclear> ewer Burger <persName resp="#ner">Lorentz Stachel</persName>, den,
<lb n="5"/>uf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heüt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Staelischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schuldtschens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesezten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rechtstag</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgefalener</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erheblicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hindernuß</unclear>, nit bsuochen khünd,
<lb n="8"/>sonder ainer prolongation begert, hat uns ewer
<lb n="9"/>deßhalb an uns abgangen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschriben</unclear>, mit
<lb n="10"/>mererem vornehmen geben,
<lb n="11"/>Sollend eüch hierüber fründt: Nachparlichen
<lb n="12"/>nit verhalten, das wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nodt=</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wendteten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> lieben mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rathsfreünd</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Johans</unclear> Ludwig de Gall</persName> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitRathn</unclear> und
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Staelischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Scheid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anders=</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sambstag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">22t</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bveld</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eijngeend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Monats</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Augusti</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nöwen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Calenders</unclear></date>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endtlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rechtstag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be=</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stimbt</unclear> und angesetzt,
<lb n="20"/>Mit fründt: Nachparlicher bit, Ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günst</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uon=</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">benambten</unclear> Ewern Burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lorentz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sta=</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">cheln</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nochmahln</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzůhalten</unclear>, das Er sich bij
<lb n="23"/>selben stellen, oder da Ime widerumb
<lb n="24"/>hinderliche Eehafften zůfallen, durch vol=
<lb n="25"/>macht vor uns ohnfehlbar eijnfindig ma=
<lb n="26"/>chen thüe, Inmaßen die klagende Staell
<lb n="27"/>sche Scheid, instendig Ires Rechtens begern,
<lb n="28"/>und auch uonumbgengclich, mit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jeni=</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Recht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unufzogenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begegnet</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurdet</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1956_7274.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>laboris dermaßen, wan den uns beed seits
<lb n="32"/>fernnere molestia abgenomen wurde. Die ehemals
<lb n="33"/>des rechtes und billichkait wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierunder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er=</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zaigende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befürderung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbar=</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschulden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beede</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiezwi=</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">göttlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnadenzeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonderes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleißes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear>.
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Geben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <origDate when="1615-07-10" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">10</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Julij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ao</unclear> 1615</origDate>.
<lb n="38"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cammerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baursman=</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raths</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgermaister</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rath</unclear> der statt Wangen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1956_7275.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1956_7276.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="41"/>Denen fuersichtigen, ersamen, und weÿßen,
<lb n="42"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und Rhat zue St: Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="43"/>unssern besonders lieben freünd und
<lb n="44"/>gueten
<lb n="45"/>nachparn.
</p>
